---
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
---

<Shell title="Tools" description="XeroLinux in-house tools: xPackageManager, Customization Hub, Scheduler Tool and more." current="/tools/" label="Xero Tools" winTitle="~/tools/xpackagemanager" winSub="xPackageManager">
      <div class="pane" data-tabs style="padding: max(14px, 2.4cqh) max(18px, 2cqw); gap: max(12px, 1.8cqh); font-size: max(13px, 1.5cqh); color: var(--text2);">
          <div class="dtop" data-pane="0" data-title="~/tools/xpackagemanager" data-sub="xPackageManager" style="gap: max(16px, 2cqw);">
            <div class="dcell">
              <img class="dshot" src="/media/xpm-demo.webp" alt="xPackageManager screenshot" loading="lazy" style="border: 1px solid var(--line);">
            </div>
            <div style="min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: max(10px, 1.4cqh);">
              <div class="kick" style="color: var(--accentL);">Flagship · System</div>
              <h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Chakra Petch', sans-serif; font-size: 2.1em; line-height: 1; color: var(--text);">xPackageManager</h3>
              <p style="margin: 0;">pacman and Flatpak in one native window, written in Rust.</p>
              <ul class="feats" style="font-size: .94em;">
                <li style="display: flex; gap: 8px;"><span style="color: var(--accentL);">▸</span><span>Install, update and remove from one place</span></li>
                <li style="display: flex; gap: 8px;"><span style="color: var(--accentL);">▸</span><span>Built-in repair tools</span></li>
                <li style="display: flex; gap: 8px;"><span style="color: var(--accentL);">▸</span><span>One-click pacman rollback</span></li>
              </ul>
              <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;">
                <div style="font-size: .8em;">On XeroLinux</div>
                <div class="cmd"><pre style="background: var(--glass); color: var(--text); border: 1px solid var(--line);">sudo pacman -Syy xpm-gui</pre><button type="button" data-copy="sudo pacman -Syy xpm-gui" aria-label="Copy command" style="border: 1px solid var(--line); background: transparent; color: var(--text);">Copy</button></div>
              </div>
              <div data-btnrow style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px;"><a href="https://github.com/xerolinux/xPackageManager" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="min-height: 44px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap; padding: 0 16px; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--text);"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="flex: none;"><path d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"></path></svg>GitHub</a></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="dtop" data-pane="1" data-title="~/tools/customization-hub" data-sub="Customization Hub" hidden style="gap: max(16px, 2cqw);">
            <div class="dcell">
              <img class="dshot" src="/media/xero-tool.webp" alt="Customization Hub screenshot" loading="lazy" style="border: 1px solid var(--line);">
            </div>
            <div style="min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: max(10px, 1.4cqh);">
              <div class="kick" style="color: var(--accentL);">Look &amp; Feel</div>
              <h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Chakra Petch', sans-serif; font-size: 2.1em; line-height: 1; color: var(--text);">Customization Hub</h3>
              <p style="margin: 0;">Every XeroLinux theme, rice and script in one app, on any Arch-based system.</p>
              <ul class="feats" style="font-size: .94em;">
                <li style="display: flex; gap: 8px;"><span style="color: var(--accentL);">▸</span><span>Desktop rices and layouts</span></li>
                <li style="display: flex; gap: 8px;"><span style="color: var(--accentL);">▸</span><span>8 GRUB themes</span></li>
                <li style="display: flex; gap: 8px;"><span style="color: var(--accentL);">▸</span><span>System scripts and tools</span></li>
              </ul>
              <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;">
                <div style="font-size: .8em;">Needs python-pyqt6, then run</div>
                <div class="cmd"><pre style="background: var(--glass); color: var(--text); border: 1px solid var(--line);">curl -fsSL https://xerolinux.xyz/script/xero-tool.py | python3</pre><button type="button" data-copy="curl -fsSL https://xerolinux.xyz/script/xero-tool.py | python3" aria-label="Copy command" style="border: 1px solid var(--line); background: transparent; color: var(--text);">Copy</button></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="dtop" data-pane="2" data-title="~/tools/scheduler-tool" data-sub="Scheduler Tool" hidden style="gap: max(16px, 2cqw);">
            <div class="dcell">
              <img class="dshot" src="/media/scx-tool.webp" alt="Scheduler Tool screenshot" loading="lazy" style="border: 1px solid var(--line);">
            </div>
            <div style="min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: max(10px, 1.4cqh);">
              <div class="kick" style="color: var(--accentL);">System</div>
              <h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Chakra Petch', sans-serif; font-size: 2.1em; line-height: 1; color: var(--text);">Scheduler Tool</h3>
              <p style="margin: 0;">Switch sched-ext CPU schedulers on the fly from a GUI.</p>
              <ul class="feats" style="font-size: .94em;">
                <li style="display: flex; gap: 8px;"><span style="color: var(--accentL);">▸</span><span>Live scheduler switching</span></li>
                <li style="display: flex; gap: 8px;"><span style="color: var(--accentL);">▸</span><span>Auto, gaming, lowlatency and powersave modes</span></li>
                <li style="display: flex; gap: 8px;"><span style="color: var(--accentL);">▸</span><span>Optional auto-start on boot</span></li>
              </ul>
              <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;">
                <div style="font-size: .8em;">Needs scx-scheds and scx-tools, then run</div>
                <div class="cmd"><pre style="background: var(--glass); color: var(--text); border: 1px solid var(--line);">curl -fsSL https://urls.xerolinux.xyz/SCXTool | python3</pre><button type="button" data-copy="curl -fsSL https://urls.xerolinux.xyz/SCXTool | python3" aria-label="Copy command" style="border: 1px solid var(--line); background: transparent; color: var(--text);">Copy</button></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="dtop" data-pane="3" data-title="~/tools/ibackup-restore" data-sub="iBackup/Restore" hidden style="gap: max(16px, 2cqw);">
            <div class="dcell">
