              </ul>
              <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;">
                <div style="font-size: .8em;">Build and install</div>
                <div class="cmd"><pre style="background: var(--glass); color: var(--text); border: 1px solid var(--line);">git clone https://github.com/xerolinux/xero-howdy-qt
cd xero-howdy-qt/Packaging/ &amp;&amp; makepkg -si</pre><button type="button" data-copy="git clone https://github.com/xerolinux/xero-howdy-qt
