              <p style="margin: 0;">Slow down a boot splash that flashes by on fast NVMe drives.</p>
              <ul class="feats" style="font-size: .94em;">
                <li style="display: flex; gap: 8px;"><span style="color: var(--accentL);">▸</span><span>Under [Service] add: ExecStartPre=/usr/bin/sleep 6</span></li>
                <li style="display: flex; gap: 8px;"><span style="color: var(--accentL);">▸</span><span>Then run: sudo systemctl daemon-reload</span></li>
                <li style="display: flex; gap: 8px;"><span style="color: var(--accentL);">▸</span><span>Change the 6 to suit your hardware</span></li>
              </ul>
